# Redesign review captures: regenerable via `M1_OUT=... node scripts/m1-review.mjs`.
# The folders stay on disk (previous review runs are immutable) but are not tracked —
# ~34 MB of PNGs would bloat history permanently. Written reviews and the summary
# comparison images ARE tracked, because they carry the argument.
docs/redesign-2026/*/shots/

# tesseract.js downloads its language model at runtime; not a source artefact
eng.traineddata
*.traineddata
